# The arena build context is the repo root, so without this Docker uploads every
# node_modules tree and the whole trace archive before it starts — minutes of
# nothing, on every rebuild.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
traces
docs
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
*.log

# Source and tests are not needed: the image runs built dist output only.
**/src
**/integration
**/__tests__
**/bench
packages/playground
packages/cli
